Murloc Fins
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Sorcerer
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Tidecaller
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Margul
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Mur'gal
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Tiderunner
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Huntsman
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Nightcrawler
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Flesheater
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Plaguebearer
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Murloc Mutant
    Actions
        Set VariableSet Random = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Random Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DyingUnitPos = (Position of (Dying unit))
                Item - Create Murloc Fin at DyingUnitPos
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DyingUnitPos)
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet Random = 0
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
